IMPORTANT: Uninstall Token Generated
============================================================

	Token: ${UNINSTALL_TOKEN}

⚠️  STORE THIS TOKEN SECURELY ⚠️

You will need this token to uninstall SafeSetID.
Recommended: Save to password manager (e.g., KeePassXC)

Uninstall command:

